.TH COVERAGE 1 "November 2026" "Kagi 0.39.0" "Developer Commands"
.SH NAME
coverage \- generate Kagi LLVM source coverage reports
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B scripts/coverage
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs
.B cargo llvm-cov
against all workspace targets.
It clears previous coverage data first.
The reports are written to
.I coverage/lcov.info
and
.IR coverage/html/index.html .
Install
.B cargo-llvm-cov
and the toolchain's LLVM coverage components before running the script.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B KAGI_COVERAGE_ALL_FEATURES
Set to 1 to pass
.B \-\-all-features
to Cargo.
The toolchains for the selected features must be available.
.TP
.B KAGI_COVERAGE_MIN_LINES
Fail if the line coverage percentage is below this value.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR test-all (1)
